title: "AUGMANITAI Compendium — Wave 1 (104 Terms)"
abstract: "Bilingual EN/DE terminology dataset of 104 descriptive terms documenting human experiences in AI interaction. Inspired by ISO 704/1087/30042 terminology-science principles. Includes operational definitions, measurement schemas, and SKOS/Croissant metadata."
